{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this local split-screen multiplayer game, 2-4 players compete to build the tallest tower by stacking randomly selected 3D objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a low poly universe with circus, theater and carnival influences, the game combines strategic construction and dynamic confrontation: players can either place their objects to stabilize their tower, or throw them at their opponent's to destabilize it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a realistic physics system, the game does not artificially detect collapses, letting gravity and tower stability determine the outcome of each game. With no time limit, it offers a competitive and immersive experience, promoting strategy and skill in a unique visual and audio environment.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908710?t=1768140632","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908710?t=1768140632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908710/4029afb1e81609132cd7061d90bfe2230c841709/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768140632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908710/4029afb1e81609132cd7061d90bfe2230c841709/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768140632","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this local split-screen multiplayer game, 2-4 players compete to build the tallest tower by stacking randomly selected 3D objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a low poly universe with circus, theater and carnival influences, the game combines strategic construction and dynamic confrontation: players can either place their objects to stabilize their tower, or throw them at their opponent's to destabilize it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a realistic physics system, the game does not artificially detect collapses, letting gravity and tower stability determine the outcome of each game. With no time limit, it offers a competitive and immersive experience, promoting strategy and skill in a unique visual and audio environment.</p>","developers":["Sophie Nadeau","Justin Bonin","Val\u00e9rie Therrien","L\u00e9o Paquet Gauthier","Alexis David"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908710/22734751cd1cda11093519648654689a420bdd08/header.jpg?t=1768140632","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908710/1785442215/1accb2befb1c4ca119385d2f8568de2f0ba7a4ce/1753918903/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754018890","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908710/1785442215/1accb2befb1c4ca119385d2f8568de2f0ba7a4ce/1753918903/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754018890","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908710/1785442215/1accb2befb1c4ca119385d2f8568de2f0ba7a4ce/1753918903/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754018890","id":257175977,"name":"Dramatour trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175977/96477d5fc141e293fbb35cfebb321ebafbf1378d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754018890"}],"name":"Dramatour","pa